      "description": "The text 'white trash britney is my spirit animal' explicitly maps the visual entity 'woman' (identified as Britney Spears) onto the derogatory label 'white trash'. This is an analogical mapping where the textual label 'white trash' is applied to the visual entity 'woman', creating the equivalence 'woman = white trash'. The term 'spirit animal' further frames this as a metaphorical or symbolic identification, reinforcing the mapping.",
